  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proposed Senior Loan to DemirBank for Supporting Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senior loan of up to $20 million to Demir Bank (Demir) to on-lend to micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) in Azerbaijan.  Most Azerbaijani enterprises range in the micro and small sized category; however, they lack access to finance.</narrative>
  </description>
